// blade/view: a template's compiled view, its file's program (decisions 0222, 0431 §4).
//
// The PHP main compiles a Blade template to (`embedded: compiled-view`), written by main's view builder and placed
// at the Blade construct each of its tokens stands for, as vue/view.rr's Vue view is. The Blade language declares
// it (`languages/blade.json`'s `embeds`, built by `embed::compiled_view` from the file's tape at its load), so this
// library derives nothing:
//   parsed(r, "php", v)   r is the file's root, v the compiled view's; host_node(n, h): the Blade node n stands for
